  "name": "luh-optical-simulations-of-a-coaxial-flash-lidar-concept",
  "notes": "The data refer to the optical simulation of a coaxial flash LiDAR concept performed using Ansys Zemax OpticaStudio. The concept is shown in the figure **Optical concept.png** attached below.\r\n\r\nThe coaxial optical path is realized with a polarizing beam splitter (PBS) and a quarter-wave plate (QWP), which together manipulate the polarization state of the laser beam. The simulation is performed for each subsystem according to its functionality.",
